<%@ Page Language="C#" CodeBehind="Login.aspx.cs" Inherits="LegacyLens.Web.LoginPage" %>
<!doctype html><html lang="zh-Hant"><head runat="server"><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" /><title>登入 · LegacyLens</title><link href="Content/site.css" rel="stylesheet" /></head><body class="login-body"><main class="login-layout"><section class="login-context"><a class="brand" href="Login.aspx"><span class="brand-mark">L</span>LegacyLens</a><h1>每一次維護，<br />都有跡可循。</h1><p>客戶服務案件工作台。從案件處理、歷程追蹤，到既有系統的穩定維護。</p><dl><dt>技術基礎</dt><dd>ASP.NET Web Forms · SQL Server</dd><dt>展示環境</dt><dd>本機限定 · 公開資料與合成情境</dd></dl></section><form runat="server" class="login-panel"><h2>登入工作空間</h2><p class="muted">使用本機初始化產生的展示帳號。</p><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="Username" Text="帳號" /><asp:TextBox ID="Username" runat="server" MaxLength="80" autocomplete="username" /><asp:Label runat="server" AssociatedControlID="Password" Text="密碼" /><asp:TextBox ID="Password" runat="server" TextMode="Password" MaxLength="128" autocomplete="current-password" /><asp:Button ID="Submit" runat="server" Text="登入" OnClick="Submit_Click" CssClass="button" /><asp:Label ID="Message" runat="server" CssClass="message" role="alert" /><p class="login-help">展示密碼保存在本機 .runtime 資料夾，不會提交到 GitHub。</p></form></main></body></html>
